notes:
The page links one other kill chain, and four defense topics.

It says the identity provider chain through Twilio, running two levels deep, prefigures exactly what the Okta support system breach would do a year later. That breach has its own kill chain. Read the two together to see what the page means by prefigures.

The page's related defense topics are IAM and cloud identity, zero trust, SaaS security, and detection engineering. IAM is identity and access management, SaaS is software as a service, and SSPM is SaaS security posture management.
